    "text_story": {
      "type": "cb-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_000g": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "CAS Abaya Dubai"
          }
        },
        "heading_000h": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Crystal Abaya Studio | Shop Abayas Online Dubai | UAE",
            "size": "medium_bold",
            "show_line": true
          }
        },
        "text_000i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Crystal Abaya Studio(CAS Abaya), we offer a stunning collection of abayas for all styles and occasions. Whether you're searching for an elegant <a href=\"/collections/black-abaya\">black abaya</a> or an exclusive <a href=\"/collections/eid-abaya\">Eid abaya</a>, we have something for everyone. To complete your abaya look we provide the option of adding dresses in different colors and styles to your abayas. All abayas are sold with matching sheilas as a set of two. However, if you are looking for a specific shade of sheila to match with an existing outfit, you can head over to our detailed collection of sheila boxes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "button_000j": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Read more",
            "link": "shopify://pages/about-us",
            "style": "solid",
            "size": "small",
            "shape": "rounded",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_000g",
        "heading_000h",
        "text_000i",
        "button_000j"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "width": "narrow",
        "alignment": "center",
        "background_color": "",
        "text_color": "",
        "padding_top": 100,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "overlapping": {
      "type": "cb-overlapping-images",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "left",
        "images_style": "side",
        "rounded": false,
        "subheading": "",
        "heading": "Explore our Abaya Collection",
        "text": "<p>CAS takes pride in specializing in daily wear, black work and occasion abayas. From elegant embroidery to intricate beadwork, we have it all. Regarding the majority of our clientele: working women, we provide a range of designs from stylish cuts to collared <a href=\"/collections/coat-abaya\">coat abayas</a>. CAS adds the touch of professionalism you require at your workplace without compromising on comfort.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections/all",
        "alignment": "center",
        "background_color": "#e7e4e1",
        "text_color": "",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "columns": {
      "type": "cb-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "column_000k": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ready-to-Wear Abayas",
            "text": "<p>In a rush? No time to wait for your customized abaya? Head over to our <a href=\"/collections/ready-to-wear-abayas\">ready to wear</a> section and save time without compromising on style. Sit back, relax and receive your abaya within 1-2 business days without unnecessary hassle. Please do note that CAS does not offer any customization, alteration, or exchange on the RTW collection.</p>",
            "link_label": "Explore collection",
            "link": "shopify://collections/ready-to-wear-abayas"
          }
        },
        "column_000l": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Customized Abayas",
            "text": "<p>Personalize your abaya with your preferred size and design at no extra cost. For customized sizes, we offer sizes ranging from XXS to 6XL and lengths from 49 to 62 inches. Pockets, side zippers, breastfeeding buttons are all added free of charge. Custom orders are delivered within 10-12 days.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn more",
            "link": "shopify://pages/about-us"
          }
        },
        "column_000m": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Abaya Size Guide",
            "text": "<p>If you are confused regarding your size, please head over to our size chart and easily choose your abaya size and length according to your body measurements and height. If you are still unsure and require further help, please do not hesitate to contact us. We are just a call or WhatsApp away.</p>",
            "link_label": "Read size guide",
            "link": "shopify://pages/abaya-size-chart"
          }
        }
      },
